  "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n## 🚀 Features\r\n- Add support for free-threaded python interpreters @benfred (#905)\r\n- use `base_frame` to avoid sampling partial frames @benfred (#911)\r\n- Add optional type checks for code, string and dict objects @korniltsev-grafanista (#885)\r\n\r\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Fix panic on FreeBSD: don't read the `nonblocking` flag when it isn't defined @KGuillemot (#903)\r\n- Avoid aborts when scanning empty interpreter sections @theomonnom (#907)\r\n\r\n## 🧰 Maintenance\r\n\r\n- publish to pypi using trusted publisher @benfred (#912)\r\n- Re-enable tests in CI for freebsd @benfred (#910)\r\n- Refactor interpreter macros @benfred (#904)\r\n",
